Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young Master Hikaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the source of the Gero family's inherent\Nmodified bloodline, the poison blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It grows exponentially more powerful\Nthe closer that you come to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, its potency is\Nproportionate to your natural lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The earliest you can obtain the next level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of potency will be no\Nsooner than 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achieving it will be your sole\Nfocus for the next two decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ripening of a perfect\Nand incurable poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.87,0:01:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison, but until that\Nexalted day arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are forbidden from taking\Nrisks that might lead to an
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,overdose you may be Fit to\Nleave the poison clan one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three doses?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.03,0:01:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Gato...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, three doses?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After an overdose like that,\Nyou've got to hurt like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But an overdose will still kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must grow accustomed\Nto toxins gradually,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,repeatedly surviving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,near fatal attacks in his
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attempt to find a bride\Nhas reaped its rewards,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the poison blood of Hikaru Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These encounters have aged his blood\Nwith decades of compressed experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allowing it to prematurely\Nmutate to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has achieved the next stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His powers have fastened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:03:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill again, can't kill again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill again, can't kill again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero, these attacks of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to bore me to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what I've\Naccomplished? The mountain of corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've built a monument of pride\Nfor the Five Great Families.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your poison's useless on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I've got your blood\Nflowing through my veins?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gator's performance, his\Nlethal dose has multiplied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gotten faster since we fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no denying you're the most\Ngifted genius of our generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took years of rigorous\Npreparation to gain this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here you jump to the\Nfront of the line to rival it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it really pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know why, ghetto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A talent like yours should\Nbe used for killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all you want is to protect your\Nbuddies like you're some kind of hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An assassin who saves lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your whole life is a dumb joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need more than that to take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look so cool and\Ncollected but I bet you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can barely stand from\Nhere on out your skill
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Talent aren't gonna help you this is a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,match between assassins\Nit's kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you better act like one\Nunless you want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To play my ultimate ace in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast blood unleashed.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.06,0:07:23.36,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an8\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad2\fscx90\fs40\c&HAAA4F7&\4c&HBFE0EC&\3c&H512BCE&\pos(325,20)}Beast Blood—Unleashed\NThe Hundred-Beast Stampede
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hundred beast stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 93 animals of Hyakko reemerge as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A supreme and feral primal cascade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It passed through him? My\Nbloodlust ran out ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I want now: to\Nfind happiness like a normal person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dodging them so fast I can't even see
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it how does he have the strength for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:08:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized something in my\Nsearch for a bride with Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't grab hold of the\Nhappiness I want, not on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I want it, I've got to\Nlend a helping hand to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I'll find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to put an end to this, Beast Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corporal Kodoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the intrinsic power that\Nharnesses the potential of one's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The numerous poisons in your body devour\Neach other over time, evolve into an apex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This incremental growth is the engine that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unleashes the abilities\Nof the modified bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carved by the events of history into\Nthe hearts of the five great families.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effects of your toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:09:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all depend on the nature of the\NCorporal Kodoku you manage to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once you've mastered\Nit, it will be incurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poison that kills anything\Nit touches without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final stage.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.51,0:09:23.85,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an8\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1.5\shad1\fscx90\fs40\c&H7E72F3&\4c&H4744D5&\3c&H3A10C6&\pos(325,20)}Poison Blood—Unleashed\NSingle Radiant Burst
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison blood unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single radiant burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a lot of build-up for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have to keep reminding\Nyou I'm immune to your...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of poison is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't purge it fast enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made the big leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got yourself the super-ultra-premium\Npoison blood, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with his arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I should thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally got a reason to\Nsoar to the ultimate height.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't need this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only need to keep the parts\Nthat are meant for killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beast built for assassination!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come at me with everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lap up every last drop of your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stuff my gut full of your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indulging that hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the nature of an assassin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a poison master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd\Never come at you head on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to me, Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even hear my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:12:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be incurable, a poison that\Nkills all that it touches without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final stage, that is the\Napotheosis of the Poison Master.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.99,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(324,278)}Heart {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}and Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this shit ton of effort\Nwas for nothing at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all the prey I've consumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fangs just weren't long\Nenough to reach them in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if this is truly how I'm going out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'm wringing out the last dregs of\Nwhat little life force I've got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm dragging every single\None of you to hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These worthless nobodies are more\Nvaluable than your own life rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fought one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is where you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, did I keep you waiting? Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Hamster Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:13:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the weakest among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How scared you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're up against a king who's absorbed\Nand controls countless beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those animals have all\Ngiven in to the rage within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, we can't forget who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those aren't just any\Nbeasts he's merged with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.05,0:14:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Befriending the wild and the feral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our greatest skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So remember those animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are not our enemies they're
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each precious and irreplaceable,\Nthere or our other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you, you worthless cattle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They called out to the beasts\Nwithin me, and they won them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Beast Master, this fight\Nwas never just between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was everyone fighting to\Nbreak free from your shackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bullshit, you grubby little worms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hamstermaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the beast blood, a\Npassage marked by the 13th
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.71,0:17:17.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,1000)\an8\fnGeorgia\fs40\b1\fscx85\bord0.3\shad3\blur2\4a&H00&\3c&H37468B&\4c&H37468B&\c&H161502&}The Rite of the Beast Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,birthday when children of\Nthe beast clan's main Family
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are given their lifelong\Npartners by the head of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the clan Toshiro is honest\Nintelligent I would even
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say he's fit to lead the\Nclan when that day comes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a tiger no a wolf would\Nbest suit him It is time our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wise leader has made a\Ndecision he will now bestow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshiro Daigo with the\Nbeast he deems most fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.45,0:17:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:17:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I humbly accept your most gracious gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes alone said it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be fit to lead this clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing suits you better than\Na scrawny rat with wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know the truth: you were\Nterrified of my skill. You knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I could push you out and\Ntake over the clan didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well fine then if that's what\Nyou think of me why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly kill your\Nold ass and take over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.51,0:18:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato's the heir to the poison clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he hit me with what has to be\Nthe deadliest toxin on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he ever let me live? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effect your toxin has on others,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.61,0:19:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it all depends on the nature of the Corporal\NKodoku you work to cultivate over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The toxin in you reflects my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never set out to see you\Ndead, or even beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My intent was to save\NArashiyama and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood of the five great families.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.23,0:19:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're born to either kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.37,0:20:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only life we have is dog-eat-dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.35,0:20:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit lying to yourself and admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our blood is not a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life, it's all the proof I\Nneed to show you you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.21,0:20:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm into DIY candy kits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like things that take\Nsome work and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that sound like a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're an idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.10,0:20:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast Master, be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any other dangerous plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't come clean, I'll -
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Byakko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Toshiro
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could still start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not getting away?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.79,0:21:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies for the trouble\Nmy brother has caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.73,0:22:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you asked, I'm the newly\Nappointed head of our Beast Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonico Dogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Beast Master is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the\Nout-to-ani-ya-wa-ta-si-bick-ri-do-ki-ri-fum-da-ri-ke-ta-ri-bu-ga-mu-chu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.09,0:22:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the\Nout-to-na-ni-yo-i-ya-na-ta-ha-ta-ri-ba-kari-un-zari-gakari-bye-bye
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, fake that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be creepy. Oh, fake that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to do my life I\Nam not sure how to do my problems
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.83,0:23:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about the realities.\NI'm so happy with my life. I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experience damage I'm gonna be full\Nof love I'm really quite a good hat
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.81,0:23:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine with my normal\Nreputation. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.13,0:23:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to give you a great hat\NI'm really quite a good hat
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to have a great\Ngame I'm gonna be great
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I think this is so?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise. I've never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.39,0:23:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.18,0:23:56.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(315,278)}Thanks, Man
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.47,0:23:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time. Thanks, man.

